@LearningKidsAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5125

### 📋 USUARIOS
GET {{LearningKidsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/usuarios
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{LearningKidsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/usuarios/1
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{LearningKidsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Juan Pérez",
  "username": "juanp",
  "password": "password123",
  "idRol": 1
}

###

### LOGIN ALUMNO
POST {{LearningKidsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/usuarios/login/alumnos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alumno1",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### LOGIN STAFF (DOCENTE/ADMIN)
